    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d187-a1">

                <pb facs="0409" n="389" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg389"/>

                <head>Mr. Welles to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 30, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>; Referring to my communication to you, dated
                    the 16th instant, on the subject of the complaint of the Spanish minister that
                    the Juniata had committed an aggression within the jurisdictional waters of
                    Cuba, in the seizure of the steamer Victor, on the 28th of May last, I have the
                    honor to transmit herewith an additional report from Commander T. H. Stevens,
                    made in compliance with an order of the department, in which he reiterates his
                    statement that the capture was made eight miles from Moro Castle, and refers to
                    other matters complained of.</p>
                <p>I am, very respectfully, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GIDEON WELLES, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the
                        Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d187-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d187-a1-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
